Machete was used in the center of Olomouc by attackers five years ago, it happened only a few dozen meters away, in front of the disco Varna in Riegrova Street.
Officers said at the time that a group of roughly ten foreigners with guns attacked the guests of the business, who stood in front of the entrance.
According to police, they had knives, sticks and machetes in their hands.
