Abandoned and empty houses in the center of Prague.
You'll be surprised, you may be walking around them every day.
One of the most glaring examples of an unused and empty house is the vast building of the former IPB headquarters in the middle of Senovážné Square.
It was supposed to work as a hotel a long time ago.
