You then grip the weapon between your forearm and shoulder just before you hit it in your face with your free elbow.
Then the knee runs to the groins, and while the attacker is writhing in pain, you wring the gun out of his hand, hit the main in the face and begin to retreat, while holding the gun pointed at him.
If an armed man is approaching you from the front, it's a similar technique - get your body out of the firing line, grab the gun and twist it so the villain can't shoot.
