Two Russian intelligence agencies were said to have participated in the attack.
New Cyber Security Advisory Council
Material about tracking the Russian footprint was encoded and only a small group of experts had access to it, Reuters wrote.
Only a small group of eight members of Congress have been briefed on public officials, called a gang of eight in the U.S.
It is made upposed by Mitch McConnell and Paul Ryan, Democrat leaders Nancy Pelosi and Harry Reid, and four members of congressional defense and security committees.
Acting Democratic Party chief Donna Brazile said on Thursday she was creating an advisory board on cybersecurity designed to "prevent future attacks and ensure first-class protection of the Democratic Party's servers."
There was a dangerous parasite in the smoked salmon of Albert.
The chain apologised.
On the basis of the consumer's initiative for health problems after consuming food Salmon wild smoked - pieces 100 g, expiration date 22.11.2016 Prague hygiene inspections were carried out in Albert stores on Wenceslas Square and Na Můstu.
The inspection found that batch L23012562/T4 with a consumption date of 22.11.2016, which the customer pointed out, is no longer available, and therefore the product of the same batch with a consumption date 11.12.2016 was removed.
The presence of Anisakis spp. Anisakis simplex was confirmed by laboratory examination.
It is a parasitic worm of the digestive tract of marine mammals.
It is dangerous for humans - larvae in the body cavity or muscular fish are a strong allergen, and man-made live larvae can penetrate through the gastric wall into the internal organs, Šticha said.
We apply to our customers very much for the problems with this branded product.
We immediately withdrew the batch from the sale and, for preventive reasons, withdrawn all other batches of this item.
The misconduct occurred on the part of the supplier we are dealing with, and at the same time we had this product tested ourselves, spokeswoman Alberto Barbora Vanko told the News.
If the customer has bought this product, he can return it in any of the chain's stores and get the money back.
Larvae will destroy the frost and sufficient heat treatment
The seller was Nekton - Vrňata.
About the occurrence of a dangerous product, hygienicians informed the Prague and Central Bohemian veterinary administrations.
According to the news server bezpecnostpotravin.cz, people after ingestioning the parasite can become ill with anisakiosis, which is manifested by severe abdominal pain, vomiting and nausea, or the disease can occur symptom-free, the Czech News Agency said.
Symptoms occur an hour to two weeks after consuming insufficiently heat-processed infected fish.
After three weeks from the onset of larva disease, they usually spontaneously leave the digestive tract.
Adult worms and larvae are sensitive to both higher and low temperatures, so they are killed either with sufficient heat treatment of fish meat or when frozen.
Veterinarians have also examined salmon from the recipient of imported goods in the Central Bohemian Region.
Three of the five samples examined had a parasite.
According to the State Veterinary Administration (SVS), the shipment with 1700 products came to the Czech Republic at the beginning of April.
Expanded, in the vast majority to the Ahold chain, has been 919 packs to date.
Petr Pejchal, a spokesman for SVS, told ČTK on Friday.
Veterinarians immediately after finding the positive samples banned sending other products from the warehouse.
